        ],
        [
          "Relative Humidity",
          "Increased significantly",
          "Increased moderately"
        ],
        [
          "Specific Humidity",
          "Increased",
          "Unchanged"
        ],
        [
          "Moisture Added to Primary Air",
          "Yes",
          "No"
        ],
        [
          "Final Temp (70°F, 60% RH)",
          "~61°F",
          "~65°F"
        ],
        [
          "Final RH (70°F, 60% RH)",
          "~100%",
          "~83%"
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "## Key Benefits of Evaporative Cooling\n\n- **Cost Effective**: Can reduce DX compressor system size and runtime\n- **Environmentally Friendly**: No refrigerants required\n- **High Temperature Performance**: More effective than DX systems at higher temperatures\n\n## Safety Considerations\n\n⚠️ **Legionella Risk**: Water systems operating between 69°F (20.5°C) and 122°F (50°C) are potential legionella sources. Proper maintenance and water treatment are essential."
    }
  ]
}